  "explanation": "The question asks for the establishment date of Guerin High School. Source D1S3 explicitly states 'Guerin was established in 1962'. Source D2S4 notes that 'More than 300 freshmen began classes in September 1962', which represents the start of operations/classes, a valid interpretation of 'established' in this context. Other dates like April 15, 1962 (groundbreaking), August 24, 1963 (cornerstone), and September 9, 1963 (new building occupancy) refer to construction milestones, not the school's establishment. The year 2004 refers to a name change/merger, not the initial establishment. Names of people, locations, and other schools are not dates."
